      "value": "As an owner of a PCVR headset, the quest headsets are very interesting to hear about. They have not a lot of processing power, between quest 2 and 3 the ram was increased by 2 gigabytes. \n\nGo into VRChat and quest users are split into two groups. First group complains about poor performance. Second group thinks that supporting PC content is definitely possible.\n\nCan you explain a little? Have you never seen some of those owners of $1000 pcs complain about performance? \n\nDid meta sell the quest 3 with \"PC level graphics\"?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
