      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}\n\nThey have more power than people give them credit for. Also, did I not mention that it would impact performance? I'm not asking for graphical levels to be increased, I'm asking for an Opt-In feature. All I am saying is that it simply is not fair that I have to pay $1000 just to be able to see some friends in either PC-Only Avatars or PC-Only worlds.",
